  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "f9vaNrMutnU5SgEsSd5HCUNfPyQ=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-30T18:30:23.589Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "LI.FI maps the agentic economy onto a four-layer protocol stack:\n\n1. **Tool integration:** Anthropic's Model Context Protocol (MCP, Nov 2024) \u2014 ~97 million monthly SDK downloads and ~5,800 active servers by Q1 2026\n2. **Agent-to-agent communication:** Google's A2A protocol, donated to the Linux Foundation June 2025, 150+ supporter organizations\n3. **Economic coordination:** Stripe-OpenAI's Agentic Commerce Protocol (Sep 2025) and Shopify-Google's Universal Commerce Protocol (Jan 2026)\n4. **Authorization & settlement:** Google's Agents Payments Protocol (AP2) with cryptographically signed Mandates, paired with Coinbase's x402 for stablecoin settlement\n\n**Why it matters:** each layer is already a multi-vendor standard, not a single company's product \u2014 the stack is composable the way the web stack was.\n\nSource: LI.FI, \"The Agentic Economy \u2014 A Deep Dive\" (https://li.fi/knowledge-hub/the-agentic-economy-%E2%80%94-a-deep-dive).",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-30T12:10:00.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-30T18:30:23.589Z"
    }
  },
